The one sentence version
Living Memory remembers not only experiences, but evolving relationships between experiences; those relationships have their own lifecycle and are selectively activated when relevant, while the LLM remains responsible for interpretation and reasoning.
I would save this version as the architectural concept, rather than implementing all of it immediately. It gives your future development a stable target without forcing today’s relatively small system to become enormous.

